<title>HUNGARY: Budapest BUX ends officially at 5,902.49 points.</title>
<headline>Budapest BUX ends officially at 5,902.49 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange closed officially at 5,902.49 points, down 82.68, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 5.69 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures were weaker for all maturities, by between 10 and 72.50 points. June BUX finished at 6,235.5 points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
